---
description: "Express and Prisma backend conventions"
globs: ["server/**/*.ts"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Prisma client only, no raw SQL.
- Validate request bodies with Zod at the route boundary.
- Return { data, meta } for lists, { error: { message, fields? } } on failure.
- 201 on create, 204 on delete, 400 validation, 404 missing.
- One error middleware catches everything; no try/catch inside routes.
- PATCH for updates, not PUT.